,222.37 L848.00,223.03 \" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#55768B\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"7 5\"/><path d=\"M100.00,49.42 L112.47,50.15 L124.93,50.87 L137.40,51.60 L149.87,52.32 L162.33,53.05 L174.80,53.78 L187.27,54.50 L199.73,55.23 L212.20,55.95 L224.67,56.68 L237.13,57.41 L249.60,58.13 L262.07,58.86 L274.53,59.58 L287.00,60.31 L299.47,61.03 L311.93,61.76 L324.40,62.49 L336.87,63.21 L349.33,63.94 L361.80,64.66 L374.27,65.39 L386.73,66.12 L399.20,66.84 L411.67,67.57 L424.13,68.29 L436.60,69.02 L449.07,69.74 L461.53,70.47 L474.00,71.20 L486.47,71.92 L498.93,72.65 L511.40,73.37 L523.87,74.10 L536.33,74.83 L548.80,75.55 L561.27,76.28 L573.73,77.00 L586.20,77.73 L598.67,78.46 L611.13,79.18 L623.60,79.91 L636.07,80.63 L648.53,81.36 L661.00,82.08 L673.47,82.81 L685.93,83.54 L698.40,84.26 L710.87,84.99 L723.33,85.71 L735.80,86.44 L748.27,87.17 L760.73,87.89 L773.20,88.62 L785.67,89.34 L798.13,90.07 L810.60,90.79 L823.07,91.52 L835.53,92.25 L848.00,92.97 \" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#B08A4A\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"7 5\"/></g></svg><div class=\"vx-legend\"><span><i style=\"background:#B8242A\"></i>合计压力变化</span><span><i style=\"background:#55768B\"></i>温漂分量 βΔT</span><span><i style=\"background:#B08A4A\"></i>漏失分量 −Qt/C</span></div></div><p class=\"ct-readout\" data-ct-result>30 min实际温差 -1.377 K（长期设定 -1.500 K）；温漂 -0.997 MPa，流失 -0.250 MPa，合计 -1.247 MPa。Ceff = 0.720 L/MPa；β = 0.724 MPa/K。即使压力上升，也可能同时存在漏流。三条曲线按相同时间逐点相加。</p></section>"
        },
        {
          "no": 3,
          "en": "SOURCES",
          "title": "数据与方法依据",
          "html": "<h2>数据与方法依据</h2><p>全部试验由固定种子的单相液体模型合成。生成环境用随压差平方根变化的小孔流量推进压力；推断以观测的压力、温度、阀门事件和加液校准为输入，采用短窗常漏率近似；评价参考是同窗实际漏率的独立积分。</p><ul><li><a href=\"https://glossary.slb.com/en/terms/p/production_packer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">SLB：封隔器隔离环空的作用</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.sintef.no/publikasjoner/publikasjon/1889270/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Raaen与Fjær：温度对屏障压力测试的影响</a></li><li><a href=\"https://nepis.epa.gov/Exe/ZyPURL.cgi?Dockey=P100ZVJD.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">EPA：机械完整性压力测试原理</a></li></ul><p>SLB解释封隔器隔离环空，SINTEF研究温度对测试判读的影响，EPA文件提供机械完整性压力测试的历史原理。门槛由课程操作者输入；压力测试对应整段系统，具体部件定位需要进一步隔离测试。</p>"
        }
      ],
      "html": "<article class=\"vx-card\"><h2>先知道被测的是哪一段</h2><p>完井把井筒连接到生产系统。油管是输送流体的管道，环空是油管与套管之间的环状空间；封隔器用于隔离这段环空。本例把关阀后的受试液体段看作一个封闭容积，压力测试观察这一整段的密封证据。</p><p>受试体积、温度和管柱的膨胀都会改变压力。原co3计算管柱温压载荷与应力；本例继续研究这些温压条件下，如何解释一次密封试验。</p></article><section class=\"ct-widget\" data-concept-scene=\"s17x-co3-completion-seal-test\" data-concept-part=\"background\"><h3>压力变化有两条同时作用的路径</h3><p>封闭液体降温会收缩，流失液体也会使压力下降；升温可抵消漏流造成的压降。先认识两个换算量：β表示每升温1 K引起多少MPa压力变化；Ceff表示增压1 MPa需要补入多少L液体。它们把温差和流失量换到同一MPa坐标，下面给定局部漏率分解两种作用。</p><div class=\"ct-controls\"><label>长期温差设定 / K<input disabled data-ct-key=\"drift\" type=\"range\" min=\"-3\" max=\"3\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"-1.5\"></label><label>已知局部漏率 / L·min⁻¹<input disabled data-ct-key=\"leak\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"0.03\" step=\"0.001\" value=\"0.006\"></label><button disabled type=\"button\" data-ct-reset>复位本图</button></div><div class=\"ct-chart\" data-ct-graphic><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 880 350\" width=\"880\" height=\"350\" style=\"min-width:880px;width:100%;height:auto;max-height:none\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"温漂与漏失对压力变化的分量叠加\"><rect width=\"880\" height=\"350\" fill=\"#F7F4EF\"/><g fill=\"#352F2D\" font-family=\"system-ui,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif\" font-size=\"16\"><path d=\"M100 284H848\" stroke=\"#DDD5CB\"/><text x=\"88\" y=\"290\" text-anchor=\"end\">-1.35</text><text x=\"100\" y=\"311\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><path d=\"M100 221H848\" stroke=\"#DDD5CB\"/><text x=\"88\" y=\"227\" text-anchor=\"end\">-0.98</text><text x=\"287\" y=\"311\" text-anchor=\"middle\">8</text><path d=\"M100 158H848\" stroke=\"#DDD5CB\"/><text x=\"88\" y=\"164\" text-anchor=\"end\">-0.62</text><text x=\"474\" y=\"311\" text-anchor=\"middle\">15</text><path d=\"M100 95H848\" stroke=\"#DDD5CB\"/><text x=\"88\" y=\"101\" text-anchor=\"end\">-0.26</text><text x=\"661\" y=\"311\" text-anchor=\"middle\">23</text><path d=\"M100 32H848\" stroke=\"#DDD5CB\"/><text x=\"88\" y=\"38\" text-anchor=\"end\">0.10</text><text x=\"848\" y=